{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://img.tvb.com/inews_admin/pro/20260514/entry_horizontal_6a051be0b0221bc870de6336_1778722147691_640x360.jpg\"><p>黑臉琵鷺被列入世界自然保護聯盟，瀕危物種紅色名錄瀕危等級，是國家一級保護動物，每年3至5月從主要越冬地台南，北飛遼寧大連莊河市繁殖。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-14T02:08:42.888549+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":66,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}